#2100
Outside a Dark Cave~
   A shelf of grey rock breaks the treeline here, and out of it
yawns the black mouth of a cave.  Cold air breathes steadily from
the darkness, smelling of wet stone and old smoke, and the ground
before the opening is stamped bare by many careless feet.
~
