#2101
On a Gravel Path~
   Here a broad drive of weed-grown gravel ends against a wall of
trunks.  Ruts in the mud show that carts once ran down from the
manor this way, but the forest has long since taken back its own.
Paths part into the trees to the east, south and west, each as
dark as the next.
~
