#2102
Within a Dark Forest~
   The trees here stand so close that their boles seem to lean
together and whisper.  Paths run away to the north, east, south
and west, yet as you watch, the shadows between the trunks appear
to rearrange themselves.  A small pile of rocks, neatly stacked,
marks the crossing like a waystone.
~
