#2152
GloomWood Forest X~
   Large, dark trees grow in this area, their claw-like branches reaching
across the sky, shredding sunlight as it falls fleecily to earth.  A cacaphony
of crowing bursts into existence as you enter this area.  The birds screach
ruthlessly from their elevated homes.  From the east, a cool breeze lightly
wafts through the area.  The sound of a river can be heard to the south and
west.  North and east of you the forest trees.    
~
