On a Gently Flowing River~
   The river spreads into a wide, slow pool here, dark and deep
enough to hide its own bottom.  The banks are steep and hung with
roots, and the forest leans over the water so closely that its
branches trail in the current.  The water deepens toward the
middle of the pool.
