Within a Hut~
   This hut reeks.  A frame of green poles stands in the middle
of the floor with hides stretched upon it, some of them still
showing hair, and beneath it a trough holds whatever is left of
the tanning bath.  The flies here have ideas about property of
their own.
~
21 0 0
S
#2194
Within a Hut~
   Haunches of venison and sides of wild pig hang from the roof
poles on bark hooks, and baskets of stolen grain stand about the
walls.  A domed clay oven occupies one corner, its floor black
with use, and a crock of sour beer sits bunged in another.
~
21 0 0
S
#2195
Within a Hut~
   A hearth of puddled clay glows faintly at the back of this
hut, with a hide bellows and a little anvil of iron set on a stump
beside it.  Lumps of bad iron, a coil of twisted arrowheads and a
half-finished spearhead litter the workbench.
~
21 0 0
S
#2196
Within a Hut~
   Dried herbs and bundles of feathers hang in every corner of
this hut, and the air is sharp with them.  A bowl of some dark
residue sits in the middle of the floor, ringed about with small
stones, and the walls have been painted with spirals in red
ochre.
~
21 0 0
