Near a Large Bed~
   A great bed stands at the back of the chamber, heaped with
furs and blankets stolen from a hundred better houses.  The manor's
silver candlesticks burn on a shield turned side-table, and a
strong bound chest sits at the foot of the bed, its lock scratched
and gouged by many patient hands.
~
