#2199
A Mediocre Throne Room~
   A mound of packed earth has been raised at the end of the
chamber and faced with slabs of stolen flagstone.  Upon it stands
the chieftain's seat: a manor chair lashed to a second chair, its
legs bound in wolf hide and its back set with a crown of boar
tusks.  The effect is less than majestic, but the tusks are
real.
~
